url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/#","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"en":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":"Tiny art is getting a massive spotlight! Small is Beautiful offers you the chance to dive into the world of the minuscule but with a grand twist. Believe it or not, 18 globally renowned artists with boundless creativity will showcase nearly 100 pint-sized wonders right in the heart of Brussels. Small is Beautiful is the perfect opportunity to experience a life-size version of the tiny! ","longdescr":"- The first-ever exhibition entirely dedicated to miniature art\n- Featuring 18 international artists showcasing 100 reduced-scale artworks, some as small as 1\/200th of their actual size\n- Embark on an unusual treasure hunt to find 5 miniature artworks hidden within the exhibition\n- Explore over 80 exhibited photos and a video area that unveils the behind-the-scenes of miniature art\n- Creative workshops to introduce the little ones to the world of miniature art\n- Don't forget to visit the unique Art Shop, where you can take home a memento from Small is Beautiful, and entry is free","performers":"    Samsofy \n    Slinkachu \n    Vincent Bal \n    Lucia Dolgopolova \n    Derrick Lin \n    Gaspard Mitz \n    Jasenko Dordevic \n    Nicolas Gu\u00e9rin \n    Le Mini di Claudia \n    Marie Cohydon \n    Hannah Levesque \n    Ana Sofia Casaverde \n    Lisa Swerling \n    David Mansot \n    Minimiam \n    Simon Laveuve \n    The Paper Ark \n    Kiu Mini Art ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/en\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"it":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/#","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"cn":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/#","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"fr":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":"L'art XXS a enfin droit \u00e0 son expo XXL ! Tu as bien lu : 18 artistes internationaux \u00e0 l'imagination gargantuesque viendront exposer pr\u00e8s de 100 \u0153uvres lilliputiennes en plein c\u0153ur de Bruxelles. Small is Beautiful est l'occasion r\u00eav\u00e9e de vivre le minuscule version grandeur nature. Pr\u00eat\u00b7e \u00e0 voyager dans le fantastique univers de l'art miniature ?","longdescr":"- La premi\u00e8re expo enti\u00e8rement consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 l'art miniature\n- 18 artistes internationaux pour 100 \u0153uvres expos\u00e9es et r\u00e9duites jusqu'\u00e0 200 fois par rapport \u00e0 leur taille r\u00e9elle\n- Une chasse au tr\u00e9sor insolite avec 5 \u0153uvres miniatures \u00e0 retrouver dans l'exposition\n- Plus de 80 photos expos\u00e9es et un espace vid\u00e9o pour d\u00e9couvrir les coulisses de l'art miniature\n- Des ateliers cr\u00e9atifs pour initier les plus petits \u00e0 l'art miniature\n- Un Art Shop unique en entr\u00e9e libre, pour repartir avec un souvenir de Small is Beautiful","performers":"    Samsofy \n    Slinkachu \n    Vincent Bal \n    Lucia Dolgopolova \n    Derrick Lin \n    Gaspard Mitz \n    Jasenko Dordevic \n    Nicolas Gu\u00e9rin \n    Le Mini di Claudia \n    Marie Cohydon \n    Hannah Levesque \n    Ana Sofia Casaverde \n    Lisa Swerling \n    David Mansot \n    Minimiam \n    Simon Laveuve \n    The Paper Ark \n    Kiu Mini Art ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/#","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"sp":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/#","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004858"},"nl":{"name":"Small is Beautiful","shortdescr":"Het moment is gekomen: XXS-kunst in een XXL-tentoonstelling! Je leest het goed: 18 internationale kunstenaars met gigantisch talent stellen 100 miniscule kunstwerkjes tentoon in hartje Brussel. Small is Beautiful is de perfecte gelegenheid om een levensgrote versie van het kleine te ervaren. Klaar om op avontuur te gaan in de wonderbaarlijke wereld van de miniatuurkunst? ","longdescr":"- Ontdek de eerste tentoonstelling geheel gewijd aan miniatuurkunst\n- Leer over 18 internationale kunstenaars met 100 tentoongestelde werken verkleind tot 200 keer hun ware grootte\n- Ga op een mysterieuze speurtocht om 5 verborgen miniatuurwerkjes te vinden\n- Bekijk meer dan 80 tentoongestelde foto's en een videoruimte om achter de schermen van de miniatuurkunst te kijken\n- Doe mee met de workshops om de kids kennis te laten maken met miniatuurkunst\n- Kom gratis langs bij de Art Shop voor een leuk souvenirtje van Small is Beautiful","performers":"    Samsofy \n    Slinkachu \n    Vincent Bal \n    Lucia Dolgopolova \n    Derrick Lin \n    Gaspard Mitz \n    Jasenko Dordevic \n    Nicolas Gu\u00e9rin \n    Le Mini di Claudia \n    Marie Cohydon \n    Hannah Levesque \n    Ana Sofia Casaverde \n    Lisa Swerling \n    David Mansot \n    Minimiam \n    Simon Laveuve \n    The Paper Ark \n    Kiu Mini Art ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smallisbeautifulart.com\/bruxelles\/nl\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.bruss