uxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Goffartstraat, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Gesticht op 17 maart 1943 door Claude Etienne is Le Rideau het oudste theatergezelschap van Brussel. Le Rideau streeft  ernaar een schouwburg te zijn voor hedendaagse - zowel Belgische als buitenlandse - auteurs. Sinds 2007 wordt het geleid door Michael Delaunoy, steeds trouw aan de ontdekkingsgeest dankzij een boeiende programmatie die de relatie tussen het intieme en de wereld onderzoekt. Le Rideau de Bruxelles is aan het werk in verschillende zalen zoals de Po\u00e8me 2, Theatre Marni, Atelier 210, Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National en Petit Varia.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":166,"location":{"lat":50.83532782,"lon":4.36969538},"last_updated_at":"2024-01-08T11:42:11+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/fc4e4e295bf813eee2ca0f2805dc749bf292d408.jpg","width":2000,"height":1597,"ratio":1.25,"oEmbed_height":1597,"oEmbed_width":2000,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"pt":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"en":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"it":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"cn":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"fr":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"sp":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"},"nl":{"title":"Juste la fin du monde ","copyright":"\u00a9Elie Carp"}}}],"dates":[{"da