nt-detail.50006133"},"cn":{"name":"Trio Alex Beaurain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006133"},"fr":{"name":"Trio Alex Beaurain","shortdescr":"Ce trio acoustique joue une musique originale et singuli\u00e8re qui provient principalement d\u2019un travail d\u2019\u00e9criture. L'exploration d'une guitare aux accordages hybrides, sert de point de d\u00e9part aux compositions. L'ensemble nous emm\u00e8ne dans un voyage musical, qui s\u2019inscrit dans un courant du jazz de chambre europ\u00e9en.\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Wg6xnSSgvmg&authuser=0\n","longdescr":null,"performers":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Wg6xnSSgvmg&authuser=0\nAlex Beaurain - guitare, Sigrid Vandenbogaerde - violoncelle,  Renato Martins - percussion\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006133"},"sp":{"name":"Trio Alex Beaurain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006133"},"nl":{"name":"Trio Alex Beaurain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Dit akoestische trio speelt originele, eigenzinnige muziek die voornamelijk voortkomt uit schrijven. Het verkennen van een gitaar met hybride stemmingen is het uitgangspunt voor hun composities. Het ensemble neemt ons mee op een muzikale reis die deel uitmaakt van de Europese kamerjazzbeweging.","performers":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Wg6xnSSgvmg&au