"fr":"Ouvert les premier, deuxi\u00e8me, troisi\u00e8me, quatri\u00e8me et dernier jeudis du mois de 15:35 \u00e0 16:35","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste donderdags van de maand van 15:35 tot 16:35","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last thursdays of the month from 15:35 to 16:35"}}],"targets":{"list":[10],"translations":{"de":["Senioren"],"pt":[null],"en":["Seniors"],"it":["Anziani"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Seniors"],"sp":["Personas de la tercera edad"],"nl":["Senioren"]}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":50004509,"date_start":"2024-01-26","date_end":"2024-01-26","date_next":"2024-01-26","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-11-17T17:45:02+01:00","published_at":"2023-11-17T17:30:50+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":289059,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[6,4],"translations":{"de":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Worldmusic, Folk e Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Worldmusic, folk y country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"pt":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"en":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":"Born in Algeria, composer, guitarist, singer, and adventurer of unusual lands, Pierre Bensusan is one of the world-renowned French musicians, as a solo artist but also through numerous collaborations with musicians such as Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel or Bill Keith, to name a few. He also inspired many artists like Suzanne Vega or Steve Vai...","longdescr":"Born in Algeria, composer, guitarist, singer, and adventurer of unusual lands, Pierre Bensusan is one of the world-renowned French musicians, as a solo artist but also through numerous collaborations with musicians such as Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel or Bill Keith, to name a few. He also inspired many artists like Suzanne Vega or Steve Vai\u2026\n\nBefore turning twenty, he conquered the musical scene with his fascinating way of playing. Starting from a mixture of Celtic music, linked to French traditions and his own work, he perfected the so-called DADGAD tuning, open and for guitar which, thanks to him, became a standard for accompaniment of folk music. Since then, he has continued to develop, research and innovate, as seen in his latest album Azwan. In addition to the elements of Celtic music and folk present in his work, he followed his musical exploration with improvisation, jazz or even Latin influences and traditional music from other regions of the world.\n\nSeeing Pierre Bensusan at work is a magnificent musical experience. A true legend whose music is an intimate and orchestral anthem, a solo journey on his instrument.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"it":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"cn":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"fr":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: La l\u00e9gende de la guitare","shortdescr":"N\u00e9 en Alg\u00e9rie, compositeur, guitariste, chanteur, aventurier de contr\u00e9es insolites, Pierre Bensusan fait partie des musiciens fran\u00e7ais de renomm\u00e9e mondiale, en solo mais aussi \u00e0 travers de nombreuses collaborations avec des musiciens tels que Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel ou Bill Keith, pour ne citer qu\u2019eux. Il a aussi inspir\u00e9 de nombreux artistes comme Suzanne Vega ou Steve Vai\u2026","longdescr":"N\u00e9 en Alg\u00e9rie, compositeur, guitariste, chanteur, aventurier de contr\u00e9es insolites, Pierre Bensusan fait partie des musiciens fran\u00e7ais de renomm\u00e9e mondiale, en solo mais aussi \u00e0 travers de nombreuses collaborations avec des musiciens tels que Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel ou Bill Keith, pour ne citer qu\u2019eux. Il a aussi inspir\u00e9 de nombreux artistes comme Suzanne Vega ou Steve Vai,\u2026\n\nAvant l\u2019\u00e2ge de vingt ans, il a conquis les sc\u00e8nes musicales avec son jeu fascinant. Au d\u00e9part d\u2019un m\u00e9lange de musique celtique, li\u00e9e aux traditions fran\u00e7aises et \u00e0 son propre travail, il a perfectionn\u00e9 l\u2019accordage dit DADGAD, un accordage ouvert pour guitare qui, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 lui, est devenu un standard pour l\u2019accompagnement de la musique folk. Depuis, il ne cesse de se d\u00e9velopper, de chercher et d\u2019innover, comme en t\u00e9moigne son dernier album Azwan. En plus des \u00e9l\u00e9ments de musique celtique et du folk pr\u00e9sents dans son travail, il a poursuivi son exploration musicale avec l\u2019improvisation, le jazz ou encore les influences latines et la musique traditionnelle d\u2019autres r\u00e9gions du monde.\n\nVoir Pierre Bensusan au travail est une magnifique exp\u00e9rience musicale. V\u00e9ritable l\u00e9gende, sa musique est un hymne intimiste et orchestral, une travers\u00e9e en solitaire sur son instrument.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"sp":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: The guitar Legend","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"},"nl":{"name":"Pierre Bensusan: De gitaar legende","shortdescr":"Met Pierre Bensusan komt een legende naar Brussel afgezakt. Deze avontuurlijke Franse gitarist, zanger en componist van Algerijnse afkomst, is een van de Franse muzikanten met wereldfaam, door zijn solowerk of zijn talloze samenwerkingen met muzikanten als Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel of Bill Keith om er maar enkele op te noemen.","longdescr":"Met Pierre Bensusan komt een legende naar Brussel afgezakt. Deze avontuurlijke Franse gitarist, zanger en componist van Algerijnse afkomst, is een van de Franse muzikanten met wereldfaam, door zijn solowerk of zijn talloze samenwerkingen met muzikanten als Nana Vasconcellos, Larry Corryel of Bill Keith om er maar enkele op te noemen. Bensusan be\u00efnvloedde tal van muzikanten en is een blijvende inspiratiebron voor artiesten als Suzanne Vega, Steve Vai\u2026 Al voor zijn twintigste veroverde Bensusan de muziekpodia met zijn virtuoze, maar tevens innemende spel. Aanvankelijk met een mix van Keltische muziek, gekoppeld aan Franse traditionels en eigen werk. Hij verfijnde de zogenaamde DADGAD stemming, een open stemmig voor gitaar die mede dankzij hem een standaard is geworden voor de begeleiding van folkmuziek. En nog steeds blijft Pierre Bensusan zich ontwikkelen, vernieuwen en op zoek naar innovaties, getuige zijn laatste album Azwan. Elementen van Keltische muziek en folk bleven in zijn werk vertegenwoordigd, maar grenzen werden verlegd naar improvisatie, jazz, zelfs latin invloeden en traditionele muziek uit andere werelddelen. Bensusan aan het werk zien is een belevenis of zoals de Schot Ian Melrose het verwoordt: \u201cHij heeft het gitaarspel naar zo\u2019n niveau getild dat, wat er ook uitkomt, het pure muziek is. Het lijkt of er bij hem geen grenzen en beperkingen zijn. Dankzij zijn fenomenale techniek heeft hij controle over elke noot. In zijn uitvoeringen en composities is hij een meester in variatie en improvisatie met fraaie harmonie\u00ebn, ritmes en melodische veranderingen.\u201d","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004509"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort , 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[10,4],"translations":{"de":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"it":["Louise","