rbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"C12","address_street_name":"rue March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"C12 est une nouvelle plateforme multidisciplinaire du collectif Deep in House. Situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, la C12 est nich\u00e9e dans les profondeurs de la Galerie Horta \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand Place et de la Gare Centrale. C12 est un endroit s\u00fbr o\u00f9 la libert\u00e9, la diversit\u00e9, la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et la culture alternative sont prot\u00e9g\u00e9es du monde ext\u00e9rieur restrictif et normatif. C'est un endroit s\u00fbr o\u00f9 la passion pour l'art et la musique sous toutes ses formes unit toutes les identit\u00e9s. Le projet comprendra des concerts, des installations artistiques, des vies, des soir\u00e9es club et le dernier mais non le moindre, un march\u00e9 local.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"C12","address_street_name":"rue March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"C12","address_street_name":"rue March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","add