d. In the Brussels region, only the Luizenmolen, which dominates the green countryside from Neerpede to Anderlecht, is still in operation. It is a wooden mill on a pivot rebuilt identically and located on the very spot of the old Luizenmolen which disappeared in 1955. Its visit will allow you to see and understand the mechanism of a mill. traditional wind as well as the production of old-fashioned flour, if however the wind is the party on the day of your visit! Maximum number of participants: 50 Additional information: http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/ Picnic: Yes","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"},"it":{"name":"Windmill visit - Luizenmolen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"},"cn":{"name":"Windmill visit - Luizenmolen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"},"fr":{"name":"Visite du moulin \u00e0 vent - Luizenmolen","shortdescr":"Visite expliqu\u00e9e du moulin \u00e0 vent","longdescr":"Visiter un moulin \u00e0 vent en activit\u00e9 est de nos jours une aventure surprenante. Elle replonge le visiteur dans une \u00e9poque o\u00f9 pr\u00e9dominaient la vie rurale, la main-d'oeuvre et les moyens de production pr\u00e9industriels. En r\u00e9gion bruxelloise, seul le Luizenmolen, qui domine la verdoyante campagne de Neerpede \u00e0 Anderlecht, est encore en activit\u00e9. Il s'agit d'un moulin en bois sur pivot reconstruit \u00e0 l'identique et situ\u00e9 \u00e0 l'endroit m\u00eame de l'ancien Luizenmolen qui disparut en 1955. Sa visite vous permettra de voir et de comprendre le m\u00e9canisme d'un moulin \u00e0 vent traditionnel ainsi que la production de la farine \u00e0 l'ancienne, si toutefois le vent est de la partie le jour de votre passage ! Nombre de participants maximum : 50 Informations compl\u00e9mentaires : http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/ Pique-Nique : Oui","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"},"sp":{"name":"Windmill visit - Luizenmolen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"},"nl":{"name":"Bezoek van de windmolen - Luizenmolen","shortdescr":"Gelijde bezoek van de windmolen","longdescr":"Vandaag is het bezoek van een windmolen in werking een verassend avontuur : het brengt de bezoeker terug in een tijdperk toen het landelijk leven en de pre-industri\u00eble arbeid en productiemiddelen in taltrijke streken nog steeds predomineerden. De Luizenmolen, die te Neerpede boven het groene landelijke gedeelte van Anderlecht pronkt, is de enige windmolen die in het Brusselse gewest nog actief bemalen wordt. De huidige molen is een houten staakmolen die identiek naar het model van de oorspronkelijke, in 1955 verdwenen Luizenmolen, op dezelfde plaats heropgebouwd werd. Tijdens uw bezoek ziet u hoe het binnenwerk van de molen functioneert en begrijpt u beter hoe het graan vroeger tot meel bemalen werd, tenminste indien de wind op de dag van uw bezoek niet te lui is om met de nodige kracht te blazen ! Maximum aantal deelnemers: 50 Aanvullende informatie: http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/ Picknick: Ja","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be\/","email":"ediederich@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003978"}},"place":{"id":267884,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Luizenmolen-Anderlecht asbl\/vzw","address_street_name":"Rue des Papillons","address_street_number":"192","address_street_box":null,"email":"ediederich@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue des Papillons, 192","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Luizenmolen-Anderlecht asbl\/vzw","address_street_name":"Rue des Papillons","address_street_number":"192","address_street_box":null,"email":"ediederich@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue des Papillons, 192","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Luizenmolen-Anderlecht asbl\/vzw","address_street_name":"Vlindersstraat","address_street_number":"192","address_street_box":null,"email":"ediederich@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.luizenmolen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 520 43 59","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 43 59","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Vlindersstraat, 192","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_ord