 \u00e9voluerez au cours de la saison gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 cet atelier cr\u00e9atif. Le tricot occupe les mains, lib\u00e8re l\u2019esprit et propose une multitude d\u2019opportunit\u00e9s cr\u00e9atives. Au fur et \u00e0 mesure de votre apprentissage technique, vous pourrez d\u00e9velopper des approches plus personnelles, collectives et artistiques \u00e0 l\u2019aide de simples fils et aiguilles.\r\nAvec Carine Degreef Les lundis soirs de 19h \u00e0 21h30 des le 18\/9 et fin le 3\/6\r\nLocal couture \r\nPrix : 465 euros","performers":"Avec Carine Degreef ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559489"},"sp":{"name":"Tricot et Crochet Cr\u00e9atif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559489"},"nl":{"name":"Tricot et Crochet Cr\u00e9atif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559489"}},"place":{"id":220532,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak, 1","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booki