efs renomm\u00e9s vous proposent de d\u00e9couvrir leur univers gastronomique aux saveurs et horizons vari\u00e9s. Du Japon \u00e0 l\u2019Italie, du Qu\u00e9bec \u00e0 Bordeaux et Paris, tout en passant par Bruxelles bien s\u00fbr \u2026 Chaque menu sera une invitation \u00e0 l\u2019exploration de nouvelles sensations gustatives. En voiture ! Les recettes sont r\u00e9alis\u00e9es \u00e0 bord avec rigueur et minutie par notre traiteur Thibault Granville (Taste Great) et son \u00e9quipe. \n\n\nTARIFS \n\nTable de 2 personnes, menu 6 services : 220\u20ac \n\nTable de 2 personnes, menu 7 services : 270\u20ac \n\nTable de 4 personnes, menu 6 services : 440\u20ac \n\nTable de 4 personnes, menu 7 services : 540\u20ac","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.tramexperience.brussels\/fr\/shop","website":"http:\/\/www.tramexperience.be","email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.531124"},"sp":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tramexperience.be","email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.531124"},"nl":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":"Laat je tijdens het 11e seizoen van de Tram Experience meevoeren op een verrassende culinaire reis in een unieke sfeer!","longdescr":"Het hele jaar lang kan je kennismaken met de gastronomische wereld van zes gerenommeerde chefs. Ontdek totaal verschillende smaken en horizonten. Van Japan naar Itali\u00eb. Van Quebec naar Bordeaux en Parijs. En natuurlijk houden we halt in Brussel. Elk menu nodigt je uit om nieuwe smaaksensaties te ontdekken. Smakelijke reis! Onze traiteur Thibault Granville (Taste Great) en zijn team bereiden de recepten aan boord met de grootste zorg en aandacht voor het kleinste detail. \n\n\nPRIJZEN \n\nTafel voor 2 personen, 6-gangen menu: 220\u20ac \n\nTafel voor 2 personen, 7-gangen menu: 270\u20ac \n\nTafel voor 4 personen, 6-gangen menu: 440\u20ac \n\nTafel voor 4 personen, 7-gangen menu: 540\u20ac","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.tramexperience.brussels\/nl\/shop","website":"http:\/\/www.tramexperience.be","email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.531124"}},"place":{"id":279379,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arr\u00eat STIB Poelaert","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Arr\u00eat STIB Poelaert","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"STIB Poelaert stop","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Arr\u00eat STIB Poelaert","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phon