ter","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"LA MAISON D'EN HAUT","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"pt":{"name":"LA MAISON D'EN HAUT","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"en":{"name":"La maison d'en haut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"it":{"name":"LA MAISON D'EN HAUT","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"cn":{"name":"LA MAISON D'EN HAUT","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"fr":{"name":"La maison d'en haut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"- De BESILI TRAFIC -\n\nUn collectif d\u2019artistes se rend dans un village pour tenter de comprendre quels sont les fonctionnements d\u2019une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e0 petite \u00e9chelle.\n\nIels sont confront\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s aux questions transg\u00e9n\u00e9rationnelles, \u00e0 l\u2019exode rurale, aux discussions politiques au coin d\u2019un terrain de foot et aux assembl\u00e9es communales interminables.\n\nUne m\u00eame histoire est pourtant racont\u00e9e entre les lignes de ces diff\u00e9rents r\u00e9cits : celle de la vie avec le trou. Un trou apparu on ne sait pourquoi, on ne sait comment, en plein milieu du village, il y a presque cent ans.\n\nComment r\u00e9agissons-nous face aux changements qui s\u2019immiscent ?\n\nS\u2019inspirant d\u2019une exp\u00e9rience commune au sein d\u2019un village jurassien, le collectif BESILI TRAFIC nous plonge dans un univers \u00e0 la po\u00e9sie crue entre fiction et documentaire et questionne avec tendresse le vivre ensemble dans un monde hant\u00e9 par le spectre de l\u2019effondrement.\n\nUne ode \u00e0 la collectivit\u00e9 et aux histoires qu\u2019on se raconte.\n\n------\nDe\u202fet par : BESILI TRAFIC : Luna Schmid, Gaspar Narby, Gilles Escoyez, Merlin Delens, Sophie Schmid, Laurie Perissutti, J\u00e9r\u00f4me Castin \/ Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8re\u202f: Florentin Crouzet-Nico, BESILI TRAFIC \/ \u0152il exterieur\u202f: Lorena Stadelmann \/ Production et diffusion\u202f: Luna Schmid, Merlin Delens \/ Soutiens \u00e0 la production : Mathilde Vreven. BESILI TRAFIC tiennent \u00e0 remercier chaleureusement la commune de Bonfol et ses habitant.es, le STAMM STUDIO, la Cie Point Z\u00e9ro, le Quai 41, Le Bois des \u00c9toiles, la Compagnie Balor, l\u2019asbl RAVIE, l\u2019\u00e9quipe de Cerni\u00e9villers, Lo\u00efc Reichenbach, No\u00e9 Gogniat, H\u00e9lo\u00efse Woitrin, Eric Delens, Pierre Escoyez et Gen Delforge, Christine Perissutti, Lucas Schlaepfer, Lydia Wespi, Lotta et Hansruedi Schmid sans qui ce projet n\u2019aurait pu d\u00e9ployer ses ailes ! \n\nUne cr\u00e9ation de Besili Trafic en coproduction avec le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Vie, Griffes asbl et RAJ. Avec le soutien du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre du Loup, CCDP, R\u00e9publique et Canton du Jura, F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles et Loterie Nationale, Loterie Romande, Fondation Ernst G\u00f6hner, Fondation Andomart, Fondation Upsilos, Fondation Loisirs-Casino.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"sp":{"name":"LA MAISON D'EN HAUT","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"},"nl":{"name":"La maison d'en haut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelavie.be\/spectacle\/la-maison-den-haut\/","email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 11 86","phone_booking":"+32 489 15 15 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001417"}},"place":{"id":10413,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Vie","address_street_name":"Rue Traversi\u00e8re","address_street_number":"45","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservations@theatredelavie.be","website":"h