g, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: van 10:00 tot 17:00"]},"date_start":"2023-10-21","date_end":"2024-01-24","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"opening":{"day":"2023-10-21","end":"17:00:00","start":"10:00:00","timestamp":"2023-10-21T10:00:00"}},{"id":50006024,"date_start":"2024-01-05","date_end":"2024-02-05","date_next":"2024-01-20","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-01-20T01:03:38+01:00","published_at":"2024-01-12T12:11:26+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":292368,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.3968502629920499,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[27,24],"translations":{"de":["Fotografie","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Photography","Art Galleries"],"it":["Fotografia","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Photographie","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Fotograf\u00eda","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Fotografie","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"pt":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"en":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"In Cuba, the Puro (cigar) is an integral part of the national identity and a veritable art of living. \nToothless old men chew a double corona, workers sport freshly rolled robustos and buxom women light panetelas.\nThese portraits illustrate a real ethnological curiosity about Santiago de Cuba. The expressive power of these mixed-race faces, often hollowed out by age, sun and smoke, seems to tell a story every time. The looks are joyful, mocking, absent or serious, the poses affected or detached\u2026 Between two puffs, these impromptu models revealed themselves, their stories, a few snippets of their lives.\nIn this exhibition, PATRICK BLANCHE\u2019s exceptional photographs show us a new facet of Cuba, transporting us to another world, not just a geographical one.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"it":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"cn":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"fr":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"A Cuba, le Puro (cigare), fait partie inte\u0301grante de l\u2019identite\u0301 nationale et constitue un ve\u0301ritable art de vivre.\nDes vieux e\u0301dente\u0301s ma\u0302chent un double corona, des ouvriers arborent des robustos frai\u0302chement roule\u0301s et des femmes plantureuses allument des panetelas.\nCes portraits illustrent une vraie curiosite\u0301 ethnologique de Santiago de Cuba. La force d\u2019expression de ces visages me\u0301tisse\u0301s souvent creuse\u0301s par l\u2019a\u0302ge, le soleil et la fume\u0301e semble chaque fois raconter quelque chose. Les regards sont joyeux, moqueurs, absents ou graves, les poses affecte\u0301es ou de\u0301tache\u0301es\u2026 Entre deux bouffe\u0301es, ces mode\u0300les improvise\u0301s se sont de\u0301voile\u0301s, ont livre\u0301 leur histoire, quelques bribes de leur vie.\nDans cet exposition, les photographies exceptionnelles re\u0301alise\u0301es par PATRICK BLANCHE nous font de\u0301couvrir une nouvelle facette de Cuba, nous transportent vers un ailleurs, pas seulement ge\u0301ographique.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"sp":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"},"nl":{"name":"Faces of Cuba - Patrick Blanche","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"In Cuba is de Puro (sigaar) een integraal onderdeel van de nationale identiteit en een echte levenskunst.\nTandeloze oude mannen kauwen op een dubbele corona, arbeiders sporten vers gerolde robuusto's en mollige vrouwen lichte panetelas.\nDeze portretten illustreren een echte etnologische nieuwsgierigheid naar Santiago de Cuba. De expressieve kracht van deze gezichten van gemengd ras, vaak uitgehold door leeftijd, zon en rook, lijkt elke keer een verhaal te vertellen. De blikken zijn vrolijk, spottend, afwezig of serieus, de poses ontroerd of afstandelijk\u2026 Tussen twee trekjes door onthulden deze ge\u00efmproviseerde modellen zichzelf, hun verhalen, een paar fragmenten uit hun leven.\nIn deze tentoonstelling tonen de uitzonderlijke foto's van PATRICK BLANCHE ons een nieuw facet van Cuba, dat ons naar een andere wereld voert, niet alleen naar een geografische.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/portraits.international","email":"julius@portraits.international","phone_contact":"+32 472 70 85 13","phone_booking":"+32 472 70 85 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006024"}},"place":{"id":280287,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Prinsengalerij","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Prinsengalerij, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Portraits International is an art gallery in the historic centre of Brussels with a cultural club and course-conferences linked to each exhibition. \nIt aims to connect people through art, promote learning from inspiring personalities and release potential.\n\nTo encourage the exchange of ideas, our cultural club meets in the evening twice a week and during a \u201cSalon de Dimanche\u201d that takes place on the last Sunday afternoon of each month (except December and January).\n\nFive major exhibitions are held each year including a group show of the winners of the Portraits International Prize (PIP). \nA prize given to help launch the artistic careers of a selection of emerging artists in collaboration with a developing network of international galleries.\n\nProfessional corporate services, team building, course-conferences and events are linked to themes of the exhibitions and can be personalised on request as part of our professional services.\n\nThe main gallery is situated in Galerie des Princes, 1000 Brussels with its annex in 16 Rue des Dominicains. \n\nIt is full of historical charm and natural light and can be rented for private events offering multi-optional break-out areas and the possibility to hold intimate events for small groups or standing events up to 150 people.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Portraits International est une galerie d'art situ\u00e9e dans le centre historique de Bruxelles, dot\u00e9e d'un club culturel et de cours\/conf\u00e9rences li\u00e9s \u00e0 chaque exposition. \nSon objectif est de connecter les gens \u00e0 travers l'art, de favoriser l'apprentissage aupr\u00e8s de personnalit\u00e9s inspirantes et de lib\u00e9rer le potentiel.\n\nPour encourager l'\u00e9change d'id\u00e9es, notre club culturel se r\u00e9unit en soir\u00e9e deux fois par semaine et lors d'un \"Salon de Dimanche\" qui a lieu le dernier dimanche apr\u00e8s-midi de chaque mois.\n\nCinq grandes expositions sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e, dont une exposition collective des laur\u00e9ats du Prix Portraits International (PIP). \nUn prix d\u00e9cern\u00e9 pour aider \u00e0 lancer les carri\u00e8res artistiques d'une s\u00e9lection d'artistes \u00e9mergents en collaboration avec un r\u00e9seau croissant de galeries internationales.\n\nDes services corporatifs professionnels, des activit\u00e9s de renforcement d'\u00e9quipe, des cours-conf\u00e9rences et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements sont li\u00e9s aux th\u00e8mes des expositions et peuvent \u00eatre personnalis\u00e9s sur demande dans le cadre de nos services professionnels.\n\nLa galerie principale est situ\u00e9e dans la Galerie des Princes, 1000 Bruxelles, avec une annexe au 16, Rue des Dominicains.\n\nElle est pleine de charme historique et de lumi\u00e8re naturelle, et peut \u00eatre lou\u00e9e pour des \u00e9v\u00e9nements priv\u00e9s offrant plusieurs zones en option et la possibilit\u00e9 d'organiser des \u00e9v\u00e9nements intimes pour de petits groupes ou des \u00e9v\u00e9nements debout jusqu'\u00e0 150 personnes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Portraits International","address_street_name":"Galerie des Princes","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"julius@portraits.international","website":"http:\/\/www.portaits.international\/","phone_contact":"+32 471 09 68 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie des Princes, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxell