to explore the capital of Europe and the whole country as you've never experienced it before! Get excited, the future of tourism is now !","longdescr":"Come and explore Belgium like never before with your whole family ! Imagine Belgium is opening a brand new virtual reality experience in the heart of Brussels. Put on your VR goggles, take off from the Grand Place in Brussels and fly over the busy city of Antwerp, discover the Bueren stairs in Liege, sail on the canals of Bruges or take part in a bike race in Flanders.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/imaginebelgium.be\/","email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 681 15 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 681 15 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.502693"},"it":{"name":"Flybox, d\u00e9couvrez la Belgique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/imaginebelgium.be\/","email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 681 15 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 681 15 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.502693"},"cn":{"name":"Flybox, d\u00e9couvrez la Belgique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/imaginebelgium.be\/","email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 681 15 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 681 15 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.502693"},"fr":{"name":"Flybox, d\u00e9couvrez la Belgique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle","shortdescr":"Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une sensation de vol ultra-r\u00e9aliste et des images immersives \u00e0 360\u00b0, \u00ab d\u00e9collez \u00bb depuis la Grand-Place pour un vol autour de la Belgique. ","longdescr":"D\u00e9collage imminent ! Survoler l'enti\u00e8ret\u00e9 de la Belgique en tyrolienne ? C'est d\u00e9sormais possible gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'exp\u00e9rience de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle Flybox ! \u00c0 l'aide d\u2019un casque VR, survolez la Belgique et d\u00e9couvrez la diversit\u00e9 de l'offre touristique que le pays a \u00e0 offrir en partant de la Grand-Place de Bruxelles. Voguez sur les canaux de Bruges, volez au-dessus de l\u2019atomium, Rejoignez une \u00e9quipe de parkour sur les marches de la montagne de Bueren ou balladez-vous en cuistax le long de la mer ... Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle, visiter la Belgique n'a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi simple !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/imaginebelgium.be\/","email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 681 15 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 681 15 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.502693"},"sp":{"name":"Flybox, d\u00e9couvrez la Belgique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/imaginebelgium.be\/","email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 681 15 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 681 15 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.502693"},"nl":{"name":"Flybox, ontdek Belgi\u00eb dankzij virtual reality","shortdescr":"Een ultrarealistisch vlieggevoel en meeslepende 360\u00b0-beelden om het land te verkennen, comfortabel en uitgerust met een VR-headset. Flybox wil een culturele en leuke activiteit zijn, toegankelijk voor het grootste aantal en vooral voor gezinnen, om kinderen tijdens de zomer (en heel het jaar door) te vermaken. ","longdescr":"Kom Belgi\u00eb ontdekken zoals nooit tevoren met je hele familie ! Stel je voor dat je heel Belgi\u00eb kan bezoeken in het hartje van Brussel dankzij een virtual reality ervaring. Zet uw VR-bril op, stijg op vanaf de Grote Markt in Brussel en vlieg over de drukke stad Antwerpen, klim over de Buerense trap in Lu