ssels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005981"},"fr":{"name":"Just Move: An hommage to Elke","shortdescr":"Une exposition participative d'ucycling art sur la mobilit\u00e9 \u00e0 Cureghem\n","longdescr":"Cureghem, plaque tournante de l'industrie de l'automobile d'occasion, d\u00e9cor d'une lutte au sein de la mobilit\u00e9.\nNotre mobilit\u00e9, quelle qu'elle soit, g\u00e9n\u00e8re des nuisances... et des d\u00e9chets. Certains - inattendus, insignifiants, mais qui n\u00e9anmoins peuvent envahir notre environnement - sont ici la mati\u00e8re premi\u00e8re d'une proposition d'upcycling art. En partie participative, l'exposition en profite pour nous inviter \u00e0 nous interroger sur notre besoin de mobilit\u00e9 et la confrontation de la diversit\u00e9 des moyens d'y r\u00e9pondre dans le quartier de Cureghem.\nIncidemment, la question de la diversit\u00e9 elle-m\u00eame, son acceptation ou pas ou seulement sous certaines formes est aussi pr\u00e9sente dans les oeuvres expos\u00e9es.","performers":"Laurent Toussaint ArtiCulE asbl","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.articule.be","email":"infos@articule.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005981"},"sp":{"name":"Just Move: An hommage to Elke","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.articule.be","email":"infos@articule.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005981"},"nl":{"name":"Just Move: An hommage to Elke","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Kuregem, draaischijf van de tweedehands auto-industrie,\nDecor van een strijd over mobiliteit.\nOnze mobiliteit, onder welke vorm dan ook, genereert vervuiling... en afval. Een deel daarvan - onverwacht, onbeduidend, maar niettemin in staat om onze omgeving aan te tasten - is hier de grondstof voor een upcycling-kunstproject. De participatieve tentoonstelling nodigt ons uit om na te denken over onze behoefte aan mobiliteit en de verscheidenheid aan manieren om daarin te voorzien in de wijk Kuregem.\nDe werken trekken de reflectie ook verder naar diversiteit op zich, of die nu wel of niet wordt geaccepteerd, of alleen onder bepaalde voorwaarden.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.articule.be","email":"infos@articule.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005981"}},"place":{"id":276270,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Circularium","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons","address_street_number":"95","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@circularium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.circularium.be\/fr\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons, 95","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Circularium","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons","address_street_number":"95","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@circularium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.circularium.be\/fr\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons, 95","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Circularium","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons","address_street_number":"95","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@circularium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.circularium.be\/fr\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Mons, 95","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"bookin