"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-01-17T16:30:08+01:00","published_at":"2024-01-17T16:28:04+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":292633,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":1.100642416298209,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"pt":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"en":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"it":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"cn":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"fr":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":"Trois clowns, une blouse blanche, des textes intimes, du carton et quelques vinyles: tel est le dispositif que nous avons choisi pour parler de la scl\u00e9rose en plaques. Un plateau vide qui laisse toute la place aux clowns pour aborder avec po\u00e9sie et d\u00e9calage le vertige d\u2019une rencontre avec la maladie. Toutes nos vies sont secou\u00e9es et secouantes. Toutes nos vies sont transformations.","longdescr":"Quel rapport entretenons-nous avec notre corps, notre entourage, la m\u00e9decine, le travail\u2026 ? Quel regard la science, les croyances, la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 nous permettent d\u2019avoir sur nos vies, nos souffrances, la vieillesse et la mort?\n\nLe clown s\u2019est impos\u00e9 comme outil de pr\u00e9dilection pour cette cr\u00e9ation. Par sa na\u00efvet\u00e9, son audace, sa force d\u2019aveu des \u00e9motions et sa capacit\u00e9 de d\u00e9rision, il nous permet de partager l\u2019intime en \u00e9vitant le t\u00e9moignage. Il nous a permis de prendre distance pour trouver la l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9 et la profondeur dont nous avions besoin pour traiter ce sujet.\n\nSans fards et sans r\u00e9ponses, trois clowns nous racontent, \u00e0 partir d\u2019une histoire singuli\u00e8re, nos transformations, notre humanit\u00e9 face \u00e0 l\u2019adversit\u00e9, seul, ensemble, en soci\u00e9t\u00e9. En s\u2019emparant de cette rencontre entre l\u2019individu et la maladie, ils d\u00e9tournent nos vertiges existentiels pour mieux nous raconter l\u2019exp\u00e9rience du vivant face \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 qui parfois se d\u00e9chire et nous laisse vacillants.","performers":"\nUne pi\u00e8ce de l'Intime Collectif et du Collectif 1984.\nProjet et textes de Carlos Bustamante\nAvec Carlos Bustamante, Jonathan De Regge, Sema Ustun\nMise en sc\u00e8ne: Julie Antoine\nLumi\u00e8res: Antoinette Clette\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"sp":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"},"nl":{"name":"Parasismique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccbruegel.be\/programme\/parasismique\/","email":"info@ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006217"}},"place":{"id":204305,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Renards, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_nu