state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":279967,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"pt":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"en":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"it":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"cn":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"fr":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":"Monte-Cristo condense les ingr\u00e9dients d\u2019une parfaite \u00e9pop\u00e9e : tout y est plus grand que nature. La grandeur de la r\u00e9volte vient de la profondeur du malheur. Mais o\u00f9 se situe la fronti\u00e8re du bien et du mal ?","longdescr":"Edmond Dant\u00e8s, jeune marin de dix-neuf ans, d\u00e9barque \u00e0 Marseille pour s\u2019y fiancer avec la belle Merc\u00e9d\u00e8s. Trahi par des \u201camis\u201d jaloux, il est d\u00e9nonc\u00e9 comme conspirateur bonapartiste et enferm\u00e9 dans une ge\u00f4le du ch\u00e2teau d\u2019If. Apr\u00e8s 14 ann\u00e9es d\u2019emprisonnement, il r\u00e9ussit \u00e0 s\u2019\u00e9vader et entreprend alors de se venger m\u00e9thodiquement de ceux qui l\u2019ont accus\u00e9 \u00e0 tort\u2026 Dans l\u2019\u0153uvre d\u2019Alexandre Dumas, \u00ab Le Comte de Monte-Cristo \u00bb demeure mythique dans la cat\u00e9gorie des romans-feuilletons. Le conteur Nicolas Bonneau, la musicienne com\u00e9dienne Fanny Ch\u00e9riaux et le guitariste Mathias Castagn\u00e9 revisitent ce monument sur le mode d\u2019un palpitant polar radiophonique \u00e0 regarder, m\u00ealant satire sociale et \u00e9lans romanesques, naissance du capitalisme et bouleversements historiques, dans lequel le spectateur succombe avec le h\u00e9ros aux jouissances sans limite de la vengeance\u2026 Pourra-t-on enfin pleurer, s\u2019\u00e9mouvoir et trembler tout en se sentant vaguement coupable ? ","performers":"Texte Nicolas Bonneau, Fanny Ch\u00e9riaux, H\u00e9lo\u00efse Desrivi\u00e8res\r\nLibrement adapt\u00e9 du roman d\u2019Alexandre Dumas\r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne Nicolas Bonneau et Fanny Ch\u00e9riaux\r\nAvec Nicolas Bonneau, Fanny Ch\u00e9riaux et Mathias Castagn\u00e9\r\nAssistanat \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne H\u00e9lo\u00efse Desrivi\u00e8res","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"sp":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"},"nl":{"name":"Monte-Cristo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559967"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"vir