ussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"pt":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"en":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":"Being a pinpoint of tradition, the Queimada is one of the essentials of Muziekpublique. The evening will begin with dance introductions by Frisse Folk. Then it\u2019s time for the ball with the performance of \u201cLes Kickeuses\u201d. At intermission, you\u2019ll be able to taste the magical virtues drink, along the backdrop of A Contrabanda's Galician bagpipes. After which \u201cLa Man Encantada\u201d will excite the public!","longdescr":"Les Kickeuses is a duo born from a beautiful meeting between Juliette Ferreira and Lolita Pariaud. Their repertoire on accordion and flute consists of traditional tunes and Western European compositions livening up folk dances. Impossible to stay still while listening to them.\n\nJuliette Ferreira: flute, voice\nLolita Pairaud: diatonic accordion, voice\nLa Man Encantada offers the guarantee of a solid Gascon folk ball, as already demonstrated at the \u201cGrand Bal de l\u2019Europe\u201d in Gennetines or during the Boombalfestival. Superbly sung melodies, traditional texts and original compositions are supported by the accordion and the mandolin and dance to the breath of the flugelhorn. The group gives pride to each person\u2019s talents: Joachim Montbord sings Gascon melodies, music of Occitan poets and traditional texts from the South-West. Gilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre brings his knowledge of traditional music from P\u00e9rigord and surrounding areas, while J\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois gives everything a touch of current music and jazz.\n\nGilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre: accordion, voice\nJ\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois: bugel, schelpen, voice\nJoachim Montbord: voice, mandolin, percussion, boha","performers":"Juliette Ferreira: flute, voice\nLolita Pairaud: diatonic accordion, voice\n\nGilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre: accordion, voice\nJ\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois: bugel, schelpen, voice\nJoachim Montbord: voice, mandolin, percussion, boha","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"it":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"cn":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"fr":{"name":"Queimada Bal Folk: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":"Plac\u00e9e sous le signe de la tradition, la Queimada est l\u2019un des incontournables de Muziekpublique. La soir\u00e9e d\u00e9butera par une initiation \u00e0 la danse par Frisse Folk. Place ensuite au bal avec les Kickeuses. A l\u2019entracte, d\u00e9gustez la boisson aux vertus magiques, sur fond de cornemuses galiciennes d\u2019A Contrabanda. Apr\u00e8s quoi La Man Encantada enflammera encore davantage le public !","longdescr":"Les kickeuses est un duo n\u00e9 d\u2019une belle rencontre entre Juliette Ferreira et Lolita Pariaud. Leur r\u00e9pertoire \u00e0 l\u2019accord\u00e9on et fl\u00fbte traversi\u00e8re se compose d\u2019airs traditionnels et de compositions d\u2019Europe de l\u2019Ouest animant des bals folks. Impossible de rester immobile \u00e0 leur \u00e9coute.\n\nLa Man Encantada offre la garantie d\u2019un bal folk gascon solide, comme d\u00e9j\u00e0 d\u00e9montr\u00e9 au Grand Bal de l\u2019Europe \u00e0 Gennetines ou lors du Boombalfestival. M\u00e9lodies superbement chant\u00e9es, textes traditionnels et compositions originales sont soutenus par l\u2019accord\u00e9on et la mandole et dansent au souffle du bugle. Le groupe fait la part belle aux talents de chacun : Joachim Montbord chante des m\u00e9lodies gasconnes et met en musique po\u00e8tes occitans et textes traditionnels du Sud-Ouest. Gilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre apporte sa connaissance des musiques traditionnelles du P\u00e9rigord et alentours, tandis que J\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois donne au tout une touche de musiques actuelles et de jazz.","performers":"Juliette Ferreira: flute, voice\nLolita Pairaud: diatonic accordion, voice\n\nGilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre: accordion, voice\nJ\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois: bugel, schelpen, voice\nJoachim Montbord: voice, mandolin, percussion, boha","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"sp":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"},"nl":{"name":"Queimada Folk Ball: Les Kickeuses, Man Encantada, A Contrabanda","shortdescr":"Deze folkbalklassieker start zoals gebruikelijk met een dansinitiatie door onze partners van Frisse Folk om vervolgens het bal met een kickstart te laten openen door Les Kickeuses. Tijdens de podiumwissel is er de rituele bereiding van de magische drank queimada, onder beleiding van onze Galicische doedelzakband A Contrabanda, waarna La Man Encantada de zaal verder in vuur en vlam zal zetten.","longdescr":"Les Kickeuses is een duo ontstaan uit een ontmoeting tussen Juliette Ferreira en Lolita Pariaud. Hun accordeon- en dwarsfluitrepertoire bestaat voornamelijk uit traditionele melodie\u00ebn en West-Europese composities, afgewisseld met enkele dansbare liederen. Onmogelijk stil te staan als dit duo van jetje geeft.\n\nLa Man Encantada staat garant voor een stevig folkbal uit Gascogne zoals ze al lieten blijken op Le Grand Bal de l\u2019Europe in Gennetines of tijdens Boombalfestival. De prachtig gezongen melodie\u00ebn, traditionele teksten en originele composities worden ondersteund door de accordeon, mandola en de bugel. De groep combineert ieders specialiteiten: Joachim Montbord zingt de melodie\u00ebn van de Gascogne en zet graag Occitaanse dichters en traditionele teksten uit het Zuidwesten op muziek. Gilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre brengt zijn kennis van traditionele muziek uit de P\u00e9rigord en omgeving mee, terwijl J\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois een vleugje actuele muziek en jazz meebrengt.","performers":"Juliette Ferreira: fluiten, zang\nLolita Pairaud: diatonisch accord\u00e9on, zang\n\nGilles De Becdeli\u00e8vre: accordeon, zang\nJ\u00e9r\u00f4me Dubois: bugel, schelpen, zang\nJoachim Montbord: zang, mandola, percussie, boha","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005252"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_str