9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort , 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[10,4],"translations":{"de":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"it":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Louise","Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"sp":["Louise","Matong\u00e9\/Saint-Boniface"],"nl":["Louiza","Matonge\/Sint-Bonifatius"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translat