 Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"},"it":{"name":"Dimanches Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"},"cn":{"name":"Dimanches Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"},"fr":{"name":"Dimanches Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":"Spectacle de marionnettes par la Compagnie De Capes et de Mots.","longdescr":"L\u2019automne est l\u00e0. Tout un petit monde pr\u00e9pare le grand passage\u00a0: l\u2019hiver sera long\u00a0! A chacun sa strat\u00e9gie. Partir ou rester\u00a0? Veiller ou hiberner\u00a0? Sortir ou rester au chaud\u00a0? Faire des provisions\u2026 quand on peut\u00a0! Un arbre, une colline, un potager, une maison\u2026 L\u00e0 se croisent des voisins, \u00e0 pelages ou plumages vari\u00e9s, qui parfois se remarquent mais souvent s\u2019ignorent.\n\nCe spectacle sans autre conte que celui de la \u00ab\u00a0vraie vie\u00a0\u00bb, est enti\u00e8rement bas\u00e9 sur des donn\u00e9es \u00e9thologiques. Outre le recours aux marionnettes dessin\u00e9es (pour le jour) ou d\u2019ombres (pour la nuit), il se distingue par l\u2019usage de sons authentiques, et non reconstitu\u00e9s (vent, pas dans la neige, cris d\u2019\u00e9cureuil ou de h\u00e9rissons\u2026), et l\u2019adoption du point de vue du blaireau (et non de l\u2019humain), qui seul prend la parole et pousse m\u00eame la chansonnette \u2013 seule entorse \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9\u00a0!","performers":"Compagnie De Capes et de Mots : Roxane Ca\u2019Zorzi et Ludwine Deblon","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"},"sp":{"name":"Dimanches Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"},"nl":{"name":"Dimanches Cont\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0Passer l\u2019hiver\u00a0\u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005150"}},"place":{"id":232783,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue de Locht","address_street_number":"91 93","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@culture1030.be","website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue de Locht, 91 93","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_v