"nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Klassisch"],"pt":[null],"en":["Classical"],"it":["Classica"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Classique"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"nl":["Klassiek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"pt":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"en":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nWhat does this have to do with SEX ?\nThat's what the inimitable Hello Shelly will be demonstrating with a lap dance.\n-\nProgram:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36","longdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nAs you know, Concerts Escapades is also a health and social rehabilitation organization.\nIn this context, we consult participants in prisons and psychiatric care centers, as well as in clubs in working-class neighborhoods, to find out their opinions on the music they would prefer to hear in concert.\n\nFor January's programme, the Brahms sextets were proposed and selected... Quite surprising, isn't it? \nBrahms is surely that slightly corpulent, hairy and bearded German who is not only appreciated by corpulent and learned people!\n\nIn all the groups, in prisons and in psychiatric care centres, he got 3\/4 of the votes.\n\nWith these two sextuors validated! The title of the concert was quickly found thanks to a naughty play on words. \nSo Sextuor became sex-'tuor'! \nWhat does this have to do with SEX?\nThat's what the inimitable Hello Shelly will be demonstrating with a lap dance.\n\n____________\n\nQuiron Quarteto :\nEdgar Gomes, viool - Ricardo Vieira, altviool - Jos\u00e9 Miguel Freitas, altviool - Maria Nabeiro, cello\n+\nVincent Hepp: Viola\nSarah Dupriez: Cello\nLapdance : Hello Shelly\n\n______________\nProgram:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36\n\n-\n\nSunday 28 January at 8.30pm at La Tricoterie (Saint-Gilles) - Salle \"Le Boudoir\" - before and after the concert restaurant and bar open.\n\n-\n\nPrice: 19\u20ac I 15\u20ac I 12\u20ac I art 27 -- Last minute Ticket on visit.brussels\n\n-\n\nIn collaboration with Le Crit and Haren prison","performers":"Quiron Quarteto :\nEdgar Gomes, violin - Ricardo Vieira, viola - Jos\u00e9 Miguel Freitas, viola - Maria Nabeiro, cello\n+\nVincent Hepp: Viola\nSarah Dupriez: Cello\nLapdance : Hello Shelly","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"it":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"cn":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"fr":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nQuel est le rapport avec le SEXE?\nC'est ce que l'inimitable Hello Shelly viendra vous illustrer cela en chairdance.\n-\nProgramme:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36\n","longdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nComme vous le savez, Concerts Escapades est aussi une organisation de sant\u00e9 et de r\u00e9insertion sociale. Dans ce cadre, nous consultons les participants en prison, dans les centres en soins en psychiatrie et des clubs dans des quartiers populaires pour avoir leurs votes sur leurs musiques pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es \u00e0 programmer en concert.\n-\nPour le programme du mois de janvier c'est les sextuors de Brahms, qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 propos\u00e9s et retenus\u2026C'est assez surprenant, non ?.. \n\nDans tous les groupes, en prisons ainsi que dans les centres de soins psy , il a obtenu les 3\/4 des votes.\n\nAvec ces deux sextuors valid\u00e9s ! Le titre du concert a \u00e9t\u00e9 rapidement trouv\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un jeu de mot coquin. \nSextuor c\u2019est donc transform\u00e9 en sex-\u2019tuor\u2019 ! \n-\nQuel est le rapport avec le SEXE?\nC'est ce que l'inimitable Hello Shelly viendra vous illustrer cela en chairdance.\n-\n-------\nProgramme:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36\n-\n\nDimanche 28 janvier \u00e0 20h30 \u00e0 la Tricoterie (Saint-Gilles) - Salle \u201cLe Boudoir\u201d - avant et apr\u00e8s le concert restaurant et bar ouvert.\n\n-\n\nTarif : 19\u20ac I 15\u20ac I 12\u20ac I art 27 -- Last minute Ticket on visit.brussels\n\n-\n\nEn collaboration avec Le Crit, le club55 et l\u2019aide aux justiciables","performers":"Quiron Quarteto :\nEdgar Gomes, violon - Ricardo Vieira, alto - Jos\u00e9 Miguel Freitas, alto - Maria Nabeiro, violoncelle\n+\nVincent Hepp : Alto\nSarah Dupriez : Violoncelle\nLapdance : Hello Shelly","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"sp":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"},"nl":{"name":"Sex with Brahms by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nWat heeft dit met SEX te maken ?\nWel, dat komt de onnavolgbare Hello Shelly illustreren al lapdansend.\n-\nProgramma:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36","longdescr":"SEX WITH BRAHMS by Concerts Escapades\n-\nZoals jullie weten is Concerts Escapades ook een organisatie voor gezondheids- en sociale rehabilitatie. \n Als onderdeel hiervan raadplegen we deelnemers in gevangenissen, psychiatrische zorgcentra en clubs in volkswijken om hun mening te vragen over de muziek die zij het liefst gebruiken voor een concert.\n-\nWe geven soms huiswerk aan mensen in de zorg of het gevang: wat is uw favoriete muziek, en wat zou je graag aan de groep voorstellen met \"Het eerste Sextuor van Brahms. \n\u201c redelijk verassend, toch? Brahms is toch die ietwat corpulente en baardige Germaan die door meestal lijvige mensen gesmaakt wordt? Edoch, nee! In elke groep, in elke gevangenis kreeg het 3\/4 van de stemmen. Samen met het 2de sextuor.  \n-\nDe titel van dit concert werd snel gevonden. De vraag werd namelijk gesteld: allemaal goed en wel, maar wat heeft dat nu met SEX te maken. \n\nWel, dit is wat de onnavolgbare Hello Shelly zal illustreren met Chairdancing.\n-\n\nQuiron Quarteto :\nEdgar Gomes, viool - Ricardo Vieira, altviool - Jos\u00e9 Miguel Freitas, altviool - Maria Nabeiro, cello\n+\nVincent Hepp: Viola\nSarah Dupriez: Cello\nLapdance : Hello Shelly\n\n-\n\nProgramma:\nJ. Brahms\nSEXtuor nr 1 opus 18\nSEXtuor nr 2 opus 36\n-\nZondag 28 januari om 20u30 in La Tricoterie (Sint-Gillis) - Salle \"Le Boudoir\" - voor en na het concert restaurant en bar open.\n\n-\nPrijs : 19\u20ac I 15\u20ac I 12\u20ac I art 27 -- Last minute Ticket op visit.brussels\n-\n\nIn samenwerking met Le Crit en Haren gevangenis","performers":"Quiron Quarteto :\nEdgar Gomes, viool - Ricardo Vieira, altviool - Jos\u00e9 Miguel Freitas, altviool - Maria Nabeiro, cello\n+\nVincent Hepp: Viola\nSarah Dupriez: Cello\nLapdance : Hello Shelly\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=6AAA9682-0ECC-F6A0-968B-2F2909DA0A7F","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 315 35 79","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005383"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T15:47:56+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276119,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_numbe