l,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":278489,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":0.7937005259840998,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"pt":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"en":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"it":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"cn":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"fr":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":"Vous dites : la vie est belle. Oui, mais si c\u2019\u00e9tait une erreur ? Pour nous, les trois s\u0153urs, la vie n\u2019a pas encore \u00e9t\u00e9 belle, elle nous a \u00e9touff\u00e9es, comme une mauvaise herbe\u2026","longdescr":"Prenez trois jeunes femmes, Irina, Olga et Macha, et quelques soldats d\u2019une garnison d\u00e9s\u0153uvr\u00e9e \u2013 sans mission et en d\u00e9route philosophique, en quelque sorte \u2026 Placez-les dans une maison familiale dont le p\u00e8re et la m\u00e8re ont disparu. Laissez-les se heurter, se fr\u00f4ler, se divertir, se repousser. Situez l\u2019action dans une ville insignifiante aux confins de nulle part, dans un vide existentiel o\u00f9 pass\u00e9 et futur semblent inconciliables et le pr\u00e9sent insoutenable.\r\nTelle est l\u2019exp\u00e9rience \u00e0 laquelle nous convie Christophe Sermet qui lit, dans cette com\u00e9die tiss\u00e9e de micro-trag\u00e9dies, une observation de l\u2019\u00eatre humain in vivo, d\u00e9tach\u00e9e de toute interpr\u00e9tation historico-politique ; une r\u00e9flexion sur la complexit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00eatre au monde et d\u2019y trouver une harmonie avec l\u2019autre ; une exploration du sentiment tragique de n\u2019\u00eatre jamais laiss\u00e9 en paix par ses d\u00e9sirs, de n\u2019\u00eatre ni au bon endroit ni au bon moment, perp\u00e9tuellement d\u00e9cal\u00e9 dans le temps et dans l\u2019espace, embarqu\u00e9 dans le drame comique du contretemps.\r\nTchekhov offre une dramaturgie du doute, de l\u2019incertitude, de la complexit\u00e9 et de la remise en cause incessante des points de vue et des opinions. \u00c0 une \u00e9poque o\u00f9 le monde num\u00e9rique appauvrit et nivelle les rapports interpersonnels, il est salutaire de revenir \u00e0 cette \u00e9criture, o\u00f9 la possibilit\u00e9 du sensible \u2013 du d\u00e9sarroi intime \u2013 passe par le ressenti collectif, entre sc\u00e8ne et salle, et dans cet entre- deux trouble o\u00f9 l\u2019on vibre ensemble.","performers":"texte Anton Tchekhov | jeu Allan Bertin (Andre\u00ef), Vanessa Compagnucci (Olga), L\u00e9na Dalem Ikeda (Fedotika), Hippolyt Doucy (Saliony), Adrien Drumel (Koulyguine), Anastasia Ganova (Irina), Gwendoline Gauthier (Natalia), Guillaume Gendreau (Touzenbach), Philippe Grand\u2019Henry (Tcheboutykine) Sarah Lef\u00e8vre (Macha), Yannick R\u00e9nier (Verchinine) |  mise en sc\u00e8ne Christophe Sermet","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"sp":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"},"nl":{"name":"Trois Soeurs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558489"}},"place":{"id":231711,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Plac\u00e9 aujourd\u2019hui sous la direction artistique de Philippe Sireuil, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs se d\u00e9finit aujourd\u2019hui comme un th\u00e9\u00e2tre mais pluriel, une sc\u00e8ne et des artistes.\r\nIl affirme ainsi le m\u00e9tissage des origines de cet art n\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 du forum grec ou sur le parvis de l\u2019\u00e9glise m\u00e9di\u00e9vale et dont il est l\u2019un des multiples h\u00e9ritiers, reprenant le t\u00e9moin de cet art qui, de tout temps, a rec\u00e9l\u00e9 toutes les peines et toutes les joies, tous les conflits et tous les d\u00e9bats de notre condition humaine, rires et larmes m\u00eal\u00e9s.\r\nIl comporte deux salles de spectacles : la grande salle, dite \u00e0 l\u2019italienne entre 255 (parterre) et 356 places (avec le balcon) et la petite salle destin\u00e9e \u00e0 des projets plus intimistes.","description_print":"Plac\u00e9 aujourd\u2019hui sous la direction artistique de Philippe Sireuil, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs se d\u00e9finit aujourd\u2019hui comme un th\u00e9\u00e2tre mais pluriel, une sc\u00e8ne et des artistes.\r\nIl affirme ainsi le m\u00e9tissage des origines de cet art n\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 du forum grec ou sur le parvis de l\u2019\u00e9glise m\u00e9di\u00e9vale et dont il est l\u2019un des multiples h\u00e9ritiers, reprenant le t\u00e9moin de cet art qui, de tout temps, a rec\u00e9l\u00e9 toutes les peines et toutes les joies, tous les conflits et tous les d\u00e9bats de notre condition humaine, rires et larmes m\u00eal\u00e9s.\r\nIl comporte deux salles de spectacles : la grande salle, dite \u00e0 l\u2019italienne de 366 places, et la petite salle destin\u00e9e \u00e0 des projets plus intimistes.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Martyrs, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Martelaarsplein","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 223 32 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Martelaarsplein, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[13,3],"translations":{"de":["Historisches Stadtzentrum","Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Historical Centre","Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Centro storico","Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Centre historique","Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Centro hist\u00f3rico","Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Historisch centrum","Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Ce