"email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"en":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"it":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"cn":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"fr":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":"\u00ab Un oiseau libre s'\u00e9lance sur le dos du vent, baigne ses ailes dans les rayons orang\u00e9s du soleil et ose d\u00e9fier le ciel. \u00bb Maya Angelou","longdescr":"\u00ab Un oiseau libre s'\u00e9lance sur le dos du vent, baigne ses ailes dans les rayons orang\u00e9s du soleil et ose d\u00e9fier le ciel. \u00bb Maya Angelou\n\nQuand, \u00e0 huit ans, une petite fille d\u00e9cide de ne plus parler, sa famille s'inqui\u00e8te. Mais, apr\u00e8s cinq ans de silence, sa vie se transforme lorsque Madame Flowers s'installe dans son village du sud des \u00c9tats-Unis et la prend sous son aile. Cette histoire est celle de Maya Angelou. Auteure, artiste et militante aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de Martin Luther King et Malcolm X, elle d\u00e9montre une r\u00e9silience hors norme et trouve enfin sa voix pour devenir l'une des femmes les plus embl\u00e9matiques de notre \u00e8re.","performers":"\u00c9crit par Eric Bouvron, Julie Delaurenti, Tiffany Hofstetter, Sharon Mann et Elizabeth Wautlet\nMise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron Avec Ursuline Kairson, Julie Delaurenti ou Sharon Mann, Vanessa Dolmen ou Margeaux Lampley, Tiffany Hofstetter ou Elizabeth Wautlet, Audrey Mikondo.\nMusicien live Christophe Charrier ou Jo Zeugma Traduction de l'anglais de Julie Delaurenti  \n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"sp":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"},"nl":{"name":"Maya, une voix - mise en sc\u00e8ne Eric Bouvron","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ouvrirlesportes.be\/maya-une-voix","email":"contact@ouvrirlesportes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002603"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Ukkel","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rodestraat, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],